     },
     {
      "name": "Narration",
      "notes": "Trey explains the Vibration of Life",
      "transcript": "TREY: Ladies and gentlemen, before we go any further, I just want to make sure everyone's in tune for the rest of the night. There's a special thing that we like to do here, in the Phish from Vermont. Right now we are beginning to saturate all of you with a little thing we call the Vibration of Life. If you close your eyes and concentrate, you'll start to feel a tingling in your inner sanctum and that's how you know it's working. And when Fish brings the hi-hat down, you're really gonna feel the Vibration of Life tickling your inner sanctum."
     }
    ]
